<title>SWITZERLAND: Adecco acquires U.S. firm American/SCI.</title>
<headline>Adecco acquires U.S. firm American/SCI.</headline>
<dateline>LAUSANNE, Switzerland 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Temporary services group Adecco SA said U.S. subsidiary Ajilon Services had taken over the business activities and certain assets of the privately-owned American/SCI group for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>American/SCI is based on Troy, Michigan, has annual sales of more than $22 million and offers comprehensive services in engineering, information technology and technical education, Adecco said in a statement.</p>
<p>The past owners of American/SCI, Kerry Reedy and Tom Van Scyoc, will leave the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
